(Around him\054 everything is broken\056 Walls that were homes\054) Tj
T*
(streets that were neighbourhoods\056 And yet the boy has found a) Tj
T*
(telescope\054 a notebook\054 and a patch of clear sky\054 and he is) Tj
T*
(carefully mapping the stars as if tomorrow were guaranteed\056) Tj
