(I have met many families in Canada who started from rubble of) Tj
T*
(one kind or another\072 a lost job\054 a war\054 a divorce\054 a new country) Tj
T*
(with no credit history\056 The ones who made it did not wait for the) Tj
T*
(ground to be perfect\056 They looked up\054 wrote down a plan\054 and) Tj
T*
(kept going\056 Hope is not a feeling\056 It is a plan you keep writing\056) Tj
